silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_24_rosetta_stone_cross_domain_sections_06_six_step_scaffold_exposition_concrete_anchor_10#profileagreement silm:hasLongDescription "The ProfileAgreement is the agreement law: forge, music, storage, governance, biology all produce the same Hom-profile from Mittens; Yoneda identifies the apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ProfileAgreement', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
